<section class="ar-hero"><div class="ar-wrap ar-grid"><div><div class="ar-kicker">Local residential & commercial service</div><h1>Aircon repairs in Durban</h1><p>Fast, practical assistance for air conditioners that are not cooling, leaking, noisy or failing to start. We assist homes, offices, shops and commercial properties in Durban.</p><a class="ar-btn" href="tel:0816150876">Call 081 615 0876</a><a class="ar-btn blue" href="/enquire/">Request assistance</a></div><div class="ar-photo"><img src="https://local-air-con-repairs.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/pexels-photo-7060811-7060811.jpg" alt="Professional aircon repairs in Durban" width="900" height="700" fetchpriority="high"></div></div></section>
<section class="ar-sec"><div class="ar-wrap"><h2>Professional air conditioning services in Durban</h2><p class="ar-lead">We provide practical air conditioning solutions for residential and commercial customers, with clear advice based on the system’s condition and the fault found.</p><div class="ar-cards"><article class="ar-card"><strong>Aircon fault finding & repairs</strong><p>Help with units that blow warm air, leak water, make unusual noises, trip power or fail to switch on.</p></article><article class="ar-card"><strong>Aircon installations</strong><p>New-unit installations and replacements for homes, offices, shops and other commercial spaces.</p></article><article class="ar-card"><strong>Servicing & maintenance</strong><p>Cleaning, airflow checks and preventative maintenance to support reliable, efficient operation.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="ar-sec ar-alt"><div class="ar-wrap ar-split"><div><div class="ar-kicker" style="color:#0878b9">Common call-outs</div><h2>When to arrange an aircon assessment</h2><ul class="ar-list"><li>The room is not reaching the set temperature</li><li>Airflow is weak or inconsistent</li><li>Water is dripping from the indoor unit</li><li>The system has become noisy or smells unusual</li><li>The unit will not start or trips the power</li><li>The aircon needs routine cleaning and servicing</li></ul></div><div class="ar-card"><strong>Repair or replacement?</strong><p>Age, efficiency, repair history and the cost of the fault all matter. We help customers in Durban understand whether repair or replacement is the more practical long-term choice.</p><a class="ar-btn blue" href="tel:0816150876">Discuss your aircon</a></div></div></section>
<section class="ar-sec"><div class="ar-wrap ar-faq"><h2>Aircon repair questions in Durban</h2><details><summary>Why is my aircon not cooling properly?</summary><p>Dirty filters, restricted airflow, component faults and refrigerant-related issues are common causes. An assessment is needed to identify the exact problem.</p></details><details><summary>Do you install new air conditioners in Durban?</summary><p>Yes. We assist with residential and commercial aircon installations and replacements in Durban.</p></details><details><summary>Do you service all major aircon brands?</summary><p>We work with the major air conditioning brands commonly used in South African homes and businesses.</p></details><details><summary>How often should an aircon be serviced?</summary><p>The ideal frequency depends on usage and the surrounding environment. Frequently used systems benefit from regular scheduled maintenance.</p></details></div></section>
<section class="ar-sec ar-alt"><div class="ar-wrap"><h2>Explore our air conditioning services</h2><div class="ar-links"><a href="/">Aircon repairs South Africa</a><a href="/services/">Aircon services</a><a href="/air-con-repairs-in-johannesburg/">Johannesburg</a><a href="/air-con-repairs-in-pretoria/">Pretoria</a><a href="/air-con-repairs-in-cape-town/">Cape Town</a><a href="/air-con-repairs-in-durban/">Durban</a><a href="/air-con-repairs-across-south-africa/">All service areas</a></div></div></section>
<section class="ar-sec"><div class="ar-wrap ar-cta"><div><h2>Need aircon help in Durban?</h2><p>Call now to discuss a repair, service or installation.</p></div><a class="ar-btn" href="tel:0816150876">Call 081 615 0876</a></div></section>
